{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18260490","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826046001:":{"text":"不……不……！","source_cn":"不……不……！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8750FF1FDED97D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826046002:":{"text":"嘘，别动","source_cn":"嘘，别动","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCA96B3344D424759","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826046003:":{"text":"否则打偏了，可不能怪我","source_cn":"否则打偏了，可不能怪我","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x2DB5B9B05E901120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826046004:":{"text":"饶了我……求您饶了我吧！","source_cn":"饶了我……求您饶了我吧！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAAB6A9560D4AC6EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826047001:1":{"text":"没想到你竟然这么快就求饶了，真是……没有骨气啊。","source_cn":"没想到你竟然这么快就求饶了，真是……没有骨气啊。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x017FECA5B1DFC9EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826047002:1":{"text":"不如这样，我们来做一个游戏如何？","source_cn":"不如这样，我们来做一个游戏如何？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6E9143AB901C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826047003:1":{"text":"如果你能答对，我就给你奖励。但要是你答错了……我也只能狠狠惩罚你了。","source_cn":"如果你能答对，我就给你奖励。但要是你答错了……我也只能...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x3534EBCB96E690E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826047004:1":{"text":"我……我不要奖励！只求求……求求您放过我！","source_cn":"我……我不要奖励！只求求……求求您放过我！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB852060346B5624B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826047005:1":{"text":"那可不是你说了算的。","source_cn":"那可不是你说了算的。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x76D6538A44128D8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826047006:1":{"text":"我问你，你们的领主……那个恶劣的小吸血鬼，有多久没出现了？","source_cn":"我问你，你们的领主……那个恶劣的小吸血鬼，有多久没出现了？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB201093439D11C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826047007:1":{"text":"我……我只是个小贵族，根本接触不到领主阁——","source_cn":"我……我只是个小贵族，根本接触不到领主阁——","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x710FD38FA734DC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826047008:1":{"text":"<shk>——啊！！！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>——啊！！！</shk>","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x319478B3A62DF551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826047009:0":{"text":"虽然我很享受你的尖叫，但看看周围——还有这么多人在等待我的恩宠，你最好想清楚了再回答，不要浪费我的时间。","source_cn":"虽然我很享受你的尖叫，但看看周围——还有这么多人在等待...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x29F71A7A2F95624F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826047010:0":{"text":"我、我说……我说！","source_cn":"我、我说……我说！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC03A0CEEEC014ECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826047011:1":{"text":"是从……从戒严以后，海歌剧院演出暂停……领主阁下就再也没出现过！","source_cn":"是从……从戒严以后，海歌剧院演出暂停……领主阁下就再也...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x90FE351E0EF0D109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826047012:1":{"text":"不、不过，月弯街发生爆炸的时候……有人说在街上看到了她……还说她受了很重的伤……","source_cn":"不、不过，月弯街发生爆炸的时候……有人说在街上看到了她...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x4DCE03962005AA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826047013:1":{"text":"但是……但是我不知道那是不是真的，我没有亲眼见到……","source_cn":"但是……但是我不知道那是不是真的，我没有亲眼见到……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC8C5D48BE743A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826047014:1":{"text":"嗯……这个问题你答得不错，我很满意。","source_cn":"嗯……这个问题你答得不错，我很满意。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x50D59295D6BDA4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826047015:1":{"text":"让我想想，该奖励你什么才好呢……","source_cn":"让我想想，该奖励你什么才好呢……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x398AD5D23E37D5EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826047016:1":{"text":"求您……求您饶了我吧！","source_cn":"求您……求您饶了我吧！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x338AC6A1B0E8FE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826047017:1":{"text":"饶了你？多么无趣的提议啊。","source_cn":"饶了你？多么无趣的提议啊。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x290028C1E3AA222A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1826047018:1":{"text":"啊，我想到了。你的奖励是……再回答我一个问题。","source_cn":"啊，我想到了。你的奖励是……再回答我一个问题。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xBB710351A680A8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1826047019:1":{"text":"修缮屋的医师——那个穆婆婆，她去哪了？","source_cn":"修缮屋的医师——那个穆婆婆，她去哪了？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x7418284EC148C2CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1826047020:1":{"text":"我、我不知道！她失踪了！","source_cn":"我、我不知道！她失踪了！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xFED6F2978B8CBCD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1826047021:1":{"text":"班题斯说她破坏了军事基地，城里到处都是通缉令……军队为了抓捕她还下了戒严令，我们连门都不敢出……","source_cn":"班题斯说她破坏了军事基地，城里到处都是通缉令……军队为...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x75AA43A6B011349A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1826047022:1":{"text":"说不定……说不定她已经被军队抓走了！对，对……她消失了那么久，肯定是被抓走了！","source_cn":"说不定……说不定她已经被军队抓走了！对，对……她消失了...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x7B174E38FBC9DEB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1826047023:1":{"text":"被班题斯军队抓走了？呵呵……","source_cn":"被班题斯军队抓走了？呵呵……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x37904B4EA6F296DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1826047024:1":{"text":"既然你这么信誓旦旦，那就别再挣扎了。乖乖受罚吧——！","source_cn":"既然你这么信誓旦旦，那就别再挣扎了。乖乖受罚吧——！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A8CCC04332B9E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1826047025:1":{"text":"<shk>不……不要！！啊——！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>不……不要！！啊——！</shk>","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9404357E9DB22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:30:1826048001:":{"text":"으악...!","source_cn":"啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA222E7BA6DBB20DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:30:1826048002:":{"text":"这不正是你所期待的？","source_cn":"这不正是你所期待的？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x717B76BBF6619D80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:30:1